## Project Objective 
To design and document a Foundational Information Security Management System (ISMS) for a private healthcare company operating in South Africa, aligned to :
- ISO 27001:2022 requirements
- POPIA ( Protection of Personal Information Act)
- National Healthcare Act 61 of 2003

  ## Scope
  This compliance program covers :
  - Patient record management system
  - Telehealth platform and video system
  - Online appointment booking portal
  -  Staff laptops and mobile devices
  -  Internal HR and Payroll system
  -  Third party integration ( labs , pharmacies)
 
